msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/oma_tools.rst:36 86cf856822134d428d259bbc3392f2f0
msgid ""
"``group_id`` (string) (required) OMA Group number (numeric ID). Examples:"
" '1388790' (p53 group), '839588' (EGFR group). Use OMA\\_get\\_protein to"
" find the group ID for a specific protein."
msgstr ""

