msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/oma_tools.rst:55 e5d5650b89604705b4e6bcf0aa9b4a81
msgid ""
"Get Hierarchical Orthologous Group (HOG) information from OMA. HOGs "
"represent groups of genes tha..."
